:: Gwylan Talk Clothes Underground Brothel
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>><<set $daily.gwylan.clothesTalk++>>
<<set $gwylanTalked.pushUnique("underground_brothel")>><<set $gwylan.progress += 2>>
