		<<link [[저항한다|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers Resist]]>><<pass 1>><<stress 15>><<trauma 12>><</link>><<gggstress>><<ggtrauma>>
	<<case 5>>
		당신도 <<his>> 손을 마주 잡는다.
		<br><br>

		<span class="nextLinkWitch"><<link [[이런 건 보고 싶지 않아. 깨어나.|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers End]]>><<stress -12>><<trauma -9>><</link>></span><<llstress>><<lltrauma>>
		<br>
		<<link [[저항한다|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers Resist]]>><<pass 1>><<stress 18>><<trauma 15>><</link>><<gggstress>><<gggtrauma>>
	<<case 6>>
		<<He>>【이가】 당신 옆에서 뒤척인다.
		<br><br>

		<span class="nextLinkWitch"><<link [[제발. 깨어나.|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers End]]>><<stress -15>><<trauma -12>><</link>></span><<lllstress>><<lltrauma>>
		<br>
		<<link [[저항한다|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers Resist]]>><<pass 1>><<trauma 15>><<pain 6>><</link>><<gggtrauma>><<gpain>>
	<<case 7>>
		<<He>>【이가】 당신을 꽉 껴안는다.
		<br><br>

		<span class="nextLinkWitch"><<link [[아파.|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers End]]>><<trauma -15>><<pain -9>><</link>></span><<llltrauma>><<lpain>>
		<br>
		<<link [[너와 함께 아플게.|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers Resist]]>><<pass 1>><<trauma 12>><<pain 9>><</link>><<ggtrauma>><<ggpain>>
	<<case 8>>
		<br><br>

		<span class="nextLinkWitch"><<link [[왜?|Gwylan Talk Clothes Flowers End]]>><<trauma -15>><<pain -12>><</link>></span><<llltrauma>><<llpain>>
